    <summary>A tray icon that lights up when Claude Code finishes or needs you</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
A speech bubble in the notification area for Claude Code.

* Turns green when a session finishes, with a notification.
* Turns amber when Claude is blocked on a permission prompt or a question.
* Lists every open session by project folder, most urgent first.
* Stays quiet for quick turns and for prompts you answer right away.
* Adds its hooks to Claude Code's settings on first launch, and the uninstaller
  removes them.

A single small executable with no runtime dependencies.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/kidchenko/suavez/releases</releaseNotes>
